  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkey &amp; Syria Earthquake Emergency Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The extent of the destruction caused by the earthquakes that struck south-eastern Turkey and north-eastern Syria last week are becoming more and more clear. What is absolutely clear, however, is that help is urgently needed. The quake with a magnitude of about 7.8 was felt as far away as Lebanon and Cyprus. Thousands of people lost their lives and almost a hundred thousand were injured. At a stroke countless people lost their homes. We must help as quickly as possible - Caritas aid is underway!</narrative>
  </description>
